ys a required variable and keeps its gate excluding 'agua'. | docs/stats_audit/research_3_base_lunar.md option R, approved by the team lead 2026-11-15 11:51 CET || Lunar base | rock_or_bare_frac | weight 0.1, bad 0.1, good 0.7 | weight 0.25, bad 0.1, good 0.7 | Weight 0.10 to 0.25 (bad 0.1 and good 0.7 unchanged): one criterion for the ground instead of two built from the same classes; the fraction is DERIVED, continuous, and leaves the urban class out. | research_3 option R, approved 11:51 CET || Lunar base | permafrost_class | weight 0.05 | not used (weight 0) | Weight 0.05 to 0: no sourced link to a base, missing on 607 of 2,419 passing points, MODELLED, non-monotonic utility. | research_3 option R, approved 11:51 CET
